The connector on the back of VS3100's is somewhat misleading. It has the
same dimensions as the 68 pin SCSI devices but actually connects to a 50 pin
SCSI-2 controller. A 68 pin SCSI terminator (male)  fits into DEC's
12-29635-01 (female) terminator. But that's about it AFAIK...

